.app-corner-button {
  position: fixed;
  right: var(--g-spacing-5, 20px);
  bottom: var(--g-spacing-5, 20px);
}
```

Button text in Russian since user speaks Russian. Also check Button "size" prop values: 'xs' | 's' | 'm' | 'l' | 'xl' — 'l' fine. view="action" is valid.

Toast name must be unique per add (add with same name updates?). Use counter or Date.now.

